OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's memorabilia
OL,4,Avalued at #500k ahead of auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA treasure trove of memorabilia from
OL,7,FLiverpool and England legend Emlyn
OL,8,FHughes's playing days including
OL,9,Fmatch-worn shirts, medals and
OL,10,Ftracksuits is going under the hammer
OL,11,Fwith an estimated value of #500k.
OL,13,FHughes, who died in 2004 aged 57, was
OL,14,Fone of Liverpool's greatest players,
OL,15,Fappearing 665 times and winning four
OL,16,Fleague titles, the FA Cup and both
OL,17,FEuropean trophies twice during his time
OL,18,Fat the Reds.
