OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's memorabilia
OL,4,Avalued at #500k ahead of auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 240 lots, which are being sold by
OL,7,Fthe late star's family, include his
OL,8,F1977 European Cup winners medal, which
OL,9,Fhas a guide price of between #40,000
OL,10,Fand #60,000.
OL,12,FHis son Emlyn Hughes Jnr and daughter
OL,13,FEmma Lynn, who have helped to catalogue
OL,14,Fthe sale, said they were "lucky to say
OL,15,Fhe was our dad".
